{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/949a195d0fe11fead170882ac1e1e67d.poster.avif?t=1755574054\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/949a195d0fe11fead170882ac1e1e67d.webm?t=1755574054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/949a195d0fe11fead170882ac1e1e67d.mp4?t=1755574054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Langit Lupa: Fast-paced multiplayer chase game set in an office environment, inspired by a classic Filipino childhood game, where you leap across desks and chairs to avoid the floor and outmaneuver your coworkers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/af52fa0dd32efe8a275e5b0afb9d61b7.poster.avif?t=1755574054\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/af52fa0dd32efe8a275e5b0afb9d61b7.webm?t=1755574054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/af52fa0dd32efe8a275e5b0afb9d61b7.mp4?t=1755574054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desks, chairs, and random office supplies have never been so fun to climb, throw, or dodge. Who knew staplers could be so dangerous?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/247f622a1ddedb20267c3186e35028ec.poster.avif?t=1755574054\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/247f622a1ddedb20267c3186e35028ec.webm?t=1755574054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/247f622a1ddedb20267c3186e35028ec.mp4?t=1755574054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your buddies, open a private lobby, and get your betrayal game on. Punch or hurl random objects at your pals\u2014even if they\u2019re not the tagger\u2014because who needs trust when you can have utter pandemonium?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/95dfe4a013ca86c6ed363234763f219b.poster.avif?t=1755574054\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/95dfe4a013ca86c6ed363234763f219b.webm?t=1755574054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/95dfe4a013ca86c6ed363234763f219b.mp4?t=1755574054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh yeah, why not make everything you see throwable?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/e7591209257dd071fb89e7867ccbdcb1.poster.avif?t=1755574054\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/e7591209257dd071fb89e7867ccbdcb1.webm?t=1755574054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/e7591209257dd071fb89e7867ccbdcb1.mp4?t=1755574054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls. No mouse required for this one\u2014just use WASD to move and J to tag. Everything else is optional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Full Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable Gameplay Objective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 Game Modes (Langit Lupa, 21, Ice-ice Water, Agawan Base, Labo-labo, Capture the Flag,\u00a0Pass the Bomb, Lipat Bayan, Claygo, Sungka, Patintero, Tumba Lata, Palosebo, Luksong Baka, Hide and Seek, Chinese Garter, Jumping Rope)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 to 10 players</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3428410?t=1755574054","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3428410?t=1755574054","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/7926b81c6853bf88c6d76c5069320e1f24a01c5a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755574054","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/7926b81c6853bf88c6d76c5069320e1f24a01c5a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755574054","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3863860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/949a195d0fe11fead170882ac1e1e67d.poster.avif?t=1755574054\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428410/extras/949a195d0fe11fead170882ac1e1e67d.webm?t=1755574054\" type=\"vide